# === Claude internal ===
# Local session state stays out of git, but .claude/skills/ is versioned
# institutional knowledge — a skill nobody else can check out is just a
# note to yourself. (A bare `.claude/` cannot be used here: git will not
# re-include a path inside an excluded directory.)
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

